<RelActCalcAuto version="0">
	<Description>Uranium enrichment (U-235, U-234, U-238, and U-232) from HPGe spectra that cover 120 to 1001 keV.
Each ROI lists the gamma lines it must contain; its extent is computed from the detector's peak width and shape, so the same preset suits any HPGe resolution.
Uses the 'Physical' model for the relative efficiency curve, meaning it takes into account the currently loaded detector efficiency (or will use a default one if not loaded), and the attenuation of the uranium and of external shielding - selecting a detector efficiency close to your detector's noticeably improves accuracy.</Description>
